  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "有限元素法",
    "sub_ename": "FINITE ELEMENT METHODS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程教導學生有限元素分析法之基本觀念。課程內容包含 (1) 勁度法於結構分析應用之簡介，(2) 勢能守恆法則，(3) Rayleigh-Ritz 法與內差法，(4) 假設變位場之分析元素，(5) 三角形元素與四面體元素，(6) 同參數性元素。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces students the concepts of finite element method. Contents of this course are：(1) application of stiffness method to structural analysis, (2) principle of stationary of potential energy, (3) Rayleigh-Ritz method and Interpolation method, (4) assumed-displacement finite elements, (5) triangular and tetrahedral elements, (6)isoparametric elements.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "CE2078材料力學、CE2070結構學(一)、CE3071結構學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "CE2078",
    "pre_sub_ename": "CE2078 MECHANICS OF MATERIALS、CE2070 STRUCTURAL THEORY(1)、CE3071 STRUCTURAL THEORY (2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
